software.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <ul class=\"d-md-flex flex-justify-between tmp-pt-lg-4 clearfix\">\n            <li\n              class=\"d-flex flex-justify-center flex-items-center width-full flex-column tmp-py-5 color-fg-default float-left f3 color-bg-overlay border rounded tmp-mb-3 tmp-mr-md-3\"\n            >\n              <span class=\"customer-story__fact-highlight lh-condensed-ultra text-normal f0-mktg d-block\">180M+</span>\n              <span class=\"customer-story__fact-highlight--label f3-mktg\">Developers</span>\n            </li>\n            <li\n              class=\"d-flex flex-justify-center flex-items-center width-full flex-column tmp-py-5 color-fg-default float-left f3 color-bg-overlay border rounded tmp-mb-3 tmp-mr-md-3 tmp-ml-md-3\"\n            >\n              <span class=\"customer-story__fact-highlight lh-condensed-ultra text-normal f0-mktg d-block\">90%</span>\n              <span class=\"customer-story__fact-highlight--label f3-mktg\">Fortune 100</span>\n            </li>\n            <li\n              class=\"d-flex flex-justify-center flex-items-center width-full flex-column tmp-py-5 color-fg-default float-left f3 color-bg-overlay border rounded tmp-mb-3 tmp-ml-md-3\"\n            >\n              <span class=\"customer-story__fact-highlight lh-condensed-ultra text-normal f0-mktg d-block\">4M+</span>\n              <span class=\"customer-story__fact-highlight--label f3-mktg\">Organizations</span>\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n\n          <span class=\"sr-only\">Businesses that utilize GitHub Enterprise:</span>\n          <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap flex-lg-nowrap flex-row flex-items-stretch flex-lg-items-center flex-lg-justify-around tmp-mt-10 tmp-mb-8\">\n              <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 d-flex flex-items-center flex-justify-center tmp-py-4 tmp-py-sm-2\">\n                <img width=\"150\" src=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/1n9IAm8PAwVzxyKGLFIg57/eba33c0d6bed7e91487f4e998860a669/spotify-with-paddin