kesvz1i7g8/RDmrAsTVuPvbb23BIcKCB/73783ce659c1d20ed2705754d430a053/Hero_Image.jpg?w=960&amp;fm=webp 960w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/RDmrAsTVuPvbb23BIcKCB/73783ce659c1d20ed2705754d430a053/Hero_Image.jpg?w=720&amp;fm=webp 720w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/RDmrAsTVuPvbb23BIcKCB/73783ce659c1d20ed2705754d430a053/Hero_Image.jpg?w=600&amp;fm=webp 600w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/RDmrAsTVuPvbb23BIcKCB/73783ce659c1d20ed2705754d430a053/Hero_Image.jpg?w=480&amp;fm=webp 480w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/RDmrAsTVuPvbb23BIcKCB/73783ce659c1d20ed2705754d430a053/Hero_Image.jpg?w=240&amp;fm=webp 240w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 755px) 90vw, 40vw\" type=\"image/webp\"></source>\n  <source srcset=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/RDmrAsTVuPvbb23BIcKCB/73783ce659c1d20ed2705754d430a053/Hero_Image.jpg?w=1200&amp;fm=jpg 1200w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/RDmrAsTVuPvbb23BIcKCB/73783ce659c1d20ed2705754d430a053/Hero_Image.jpg?w=960&amp;fm=jpg 960w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/RDmrAsTVuPvbb23BIcKCB/73783ce659c1d20ed2705754d430a053/Hero_Image.jpg?w=720&amp;fm=jpg 720w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/RDmrAsTVuPvbb23BIcKCB/73783ce659c1d20ed2705754d430a053/Hero_Image.jpg?w=600&amp;fm=jpg 600w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/RDmrAsTVuPvbb23BIcKCB/73783ce659c1d20ed2705754d430a053/Hero_Image.jpg?w=480&amp;fm=jpg 480w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/RDmrAsTVuPvbb23BIcKCB/73783ce659c1d20ed2705754d430a053/Hero_Image.jpg?w=240&amp;fm=jpg 240w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 755px) 90vw, 40vw\" type=\"image/jpeg\"></source>\n  <img class=\"d-block width-full height-full object-fit-cover rounded-2\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1400\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/RDmrAsTVuPvbb23BIcKCB/73783ce659c1d20ed2705754d430a053/Hero_Image.jpg?w=1200&amp;fm=jpg\" />\n</picture>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <h3  class=\"f4-mktg color-fg-muted pb-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> Philips</h3>\n    <p  class=\"h6-mktg color-fg-default py-1 tmp-pb-sm-4 text-semibold\">Philips builds and deploys digital health technology faster with innersource on GitHub. </p>\n    <p class=\"f4 d-block d-sm-inline no-underline text-semibold arrow-target-mktg color-fg-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      Read story <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"octicon arrow-symbol-mktg octicon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M7.28033 3.21967C6.98744 2.92678 6.51256 2.92678 6.21967 3.21967C5.92678 3.51256 5.92678 3.98744 6.21967 4.28033L7.28033 3.21967ZM11 8L11.5303 8.53033C11.8232 8.23744 11.8232 7.76256 11.5303 7.46967L11 8ZM6.21967 11.7197C5.92678 12.0126 5.92678 12.4874 6.21967 12.7803C6.51256 13.0732 6.98744 13.0732 7.28033 12.7803L6.21967 11.7197ZM6.21967 4.28033L10.4697 8.53033L11.5303 7.46967L7.28033 3.21967L6.21967 4.28033ZM10.4697 7.46967L6.21967 11.7197L7.28033 12.7803L11.5303 8.53033L10.4697 7.46967Z\"></path><path class=\"octicon-chevrow-stem\" stroke=\"currentColor\" d=\"M1.75 8H11\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg>\n    </p>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"col-lg-12 d-none d-lg-block tmp-mt-9 tmp-mt-lg-11\">\n  <div class=\"col-lg-10 color-bg-subtle tmp-pt-7 Box border-bottom-0 rounded-bottom-0\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-lg-12 d-flex flex-column flex-lg-row tmp-mt-4 tmp-mb-9 tmp-my-lg-0\">\n  <div class=\"color-bg-subtle col-lg-7 border-lg-left d-flex flex-items-center tmp-mx-3 tmp-mx-lg-0\">\n    <div class=\"offset-lg-1 col-lg-10 tmp-py-6 tmp-py-lg-0 tmp-px-3 tmp-px-lg-0 border border-lg-0 rounded-top-2\">\n      <div class=\"d-flex flex-justify-start flex-items-start flex-lg-items-center tmp-mb-3 tmp-mb-lg-5 flex-column flex-lg-row\">\n          <img  width=\"150\" src=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/5fqAlq01YTFbZ5WF6Utcgh/0bc14b4b4bf75d6d779b6174be6e2d44/Duolingo_landscape-lockup_RGB.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"tmp-pr-3 tmp-mr-3 tmp-mb-4 tmp-mb-lg-0 customer-story__logo customer-story__logo--colored border-lg-right\">\n\n        GitHub Enterprise\n      </div>\n\n      <h3 class=\"h1 tmp-mb-4\">Duolingo empowers its engineers to be force multipliers for expertise with GitHub Copilot.</h3>\n\n      <a class=\"btn-mktg\" href=\"/customer-stories/duolingo\">\n        <span class=\"sr-only\">Read more about Duolingo and GitHub&apos;s story</span>\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-semibold\">Read story <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"octicon arrow-symbol-mktg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M7.28033 3.21967C6.98744 2.92678 6.51256 2.92678 6.21967 3.21967C5.92678 3.51256 5.92678 3.98744 6.21967 4.28033L7.28033 3.21967ZM11 8L11.5303 8.53033C11.8232 8.23744 11.8232 7.76256 11.5303 7.46967L11 8ZM6.21967 11.7197C5.92678 12.0126 5.92678 12.4874 6.21967 12.7803C6.51256 13.0732 6.98744 13.0732 7.28033 12.7803L6.21967 11.7197ZM6.21967 4.28033L10.4697 8.53033L11.5303 7.46967L7.28033 3.21967L6.21967 4.28033ZM10.4697 7.46967L6.21967 11.7197L7.28033 12.7803L11.5303 8.53033L10.4697 7.46967Z\"></path><path class=\"octicon-chevrow-stem\" stroke=\"currentColor\" d=\"M1.75 8H11\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span>\n</a>\n        <ul class=\"d-md-flex flex-justify-between tmp-pt-5\">\n            <li  class=\"d-flex flex-column flex-items-start tmp-pb-4 tmp-pb-md-0 pr-2 color-fg-muted customer-story__figures float-left\">\n              <span class=\"highlighted-story__fact customer-story__fact-highlight text-normal lh-condensed-ultra f0-mktg d-block\">25%</span>\n              increase in developer speed with GitHub Copilot\n            </li>\n            <li  class=\"d-flex flex-column flex-items-start tmp-pb-4 tmp-pb-md-0 pr-2 color-fg-muted customer-story__figures float-left\">\n              <span class=\"highlighted-story__fact customer-story__fact-highlight text-normal lh-condensed-ultra f0-mktg d-block\">1m</span>\n              set-up time for largest repo with Codespaces\n            </li>\n            <li  class=\"d-flex flex-column flex-items-start tmp-pb-4 tmp-pb-md-0 pr-2 color-fg-muted customer-story__figures float-left\">\n              <span class=\"highlighted-story__fact customer-story__fact-highlight text-normal lh-condensed-ultra f0-mktg d-block\">67%</span>\n              decrease in median code review turnaround time\n            </li>\n            <li  class=\"d-flex flex-column flex-items-start tmp-pb-4 tmp-pb-md-0 pr-2 color-fg-muted customer-story__figures float-left\">\n              <span class=\"highlighted-story__fact customer-story__fact-highlight text-normal lh-condensed-ultra f0-mktg d-block\">70%</span>\n              increase in pull requests\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col-lg-5\">\n      <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"0\" width=\"0\" class=\"position-absolute\" >\n  <defs>\n      <linearGradient id=\"highlight-gradient-dark\">\n        <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#D2A8FF\"/>\n        <stop offset=\"40%\" stop-color=\"#F778BA\"/>\n        <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#FF7B72\"/>\n      </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n</svg>\n\n<div\n  class=\"d-flex position-relative highlighted-story__highlights rounded-2 overflow-hidden tmp-pt-8 tmp-pr-7 tmp-pb-3 tmp-pl-7\"\n  data-color-mode=\"dark\"\n  data-dark-theme=\"dark\"\n  \n>\n  <picture>\n  <source srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/assets/highlighted-story-background-00cf59ae6763.png?width=35&amp;format=webpll 35w,https://github.githubassets.com/assets/highlighted-story-background-00cf59ae6763.png?width=28&amp;format=webpll 28w,https://github.githubassets.com/assets/highlighted-story-background-00cf59ae6763.png?width=21&amp;format=webpll 21w,https://github.githubassets.com/assets/highlighted-story-background-00cf59ae6763.png?width=17&amp;format=webpll 17w,https://github.githubassets.com/assets/highlighted-story-background-00cf59ae6763.png?width=14&amp;format=webpll 14w,https://github.githubassets.com/assets/highlighted-story-background-00cf59ae6763.png?width=7&amp;format=webpll 7w\" sizes=\"\" type=\"image/webp\"></source>\n  <source srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/assets/highlighted-story-background-00cf59ae6763.png 35w,https://github.githubassets.com/assets/highlighted-story-background-00cf59ae6763.png?width=17 17w,https://github.githubassets.com/assets/highlighted-story-background-00cf59ae6763.png?width=14 14w,https://github.githubassets.com/assets/highlighted-story-background-00cf59ae6763.png?width=8 8w\" sizes=\"\" type=\"image/png\"></source>\n  <img class=\"position-absolute top-0 left-0 bottom-0 width-full height-full customer-story-img-cover\" width=\"35\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/assets/highlighted-story-background-00cf59ae6763.png\" />\n</picture>\n\n\n  <dl class=\"position-relative d-flex flex-column flex-justify-between my-0 tmp-ml-3 tmp-ml-lg-0\">\n\n\n      <dt  class=\"position-relative color-fg-default tmp-pl-5 tmp-pl-lg-7 mb-2 text-semibold \">\n        <span class=\"position-absolute top-0 bottom-0 d-flex flex-items-center flex-justify-center customer-stories__fact-icon customer-stories__fact-icon--dark\">\n          <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-issue-opened\">\n    <path d=\"M8 9.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3Z\"></path><path d=\"M8 0a8 8 0 1 1 0 16A8 8 0 0 1 8 0ZM1.5 8a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 13 0 6.5 6.5 0 0 0-13 0Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n        </span>\n\n        Problem\n      </dt>\n      <dd class=\"story-highlights-richtext color-fg-muted tmp-pb-5 tmp-pl-5 tmp-pl-lg-7 mb-1 border-left\">\n        <p>Inconsistent standards and workflows limited developer mobility and efficiency, limiting Duolingo’s ability to expand its content and deliver on its core mission. </p>\n      </dd>\n\n\n      <dt  class=\"position-relative color-fg-default tmp-pl-5 tmp-pl-lg-7 mb-2 text-semibold \">\n        <span class=\"position-absolute top-0 bottom-0 d-flex flex-items-center flex-justify-center customer-stories__fact-icon customer-stories__fact-icon--dark\">\n          <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-issue-closed\">\n    <path d=\"M11.28 6.78a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06-1.06L7.25 8.69 5.78 7.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2 2a.75.75 0 0 0 1.06 0l3.5-3.5Z\"></path><path d=\"M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Zm-1.5 0a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-13 0 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 13 0Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n        </span>\n\n        Solution\n      </dt>\n      <dd class=\"story-highlights-richtext color-fg-muted tmp-pb-5 tmp-pl-5 tmp-pl-lg-7 mb-1 border-left\">\n        <p>GitHub Copilot, Codespaces, and custom API integrations enforce code consistency, accelerate developer speed, and remove the barriers to using engineering as a force multiplier for expertise.</p>\n      </dd>\n\n  </dl>\n</div>\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-lg-12 d-none d-lg-block tmp-mb-11 tmp-mb-lg-12\">\n  <div class=\"col-lg-10 color-bg-subtle tmp-pt-7 Box border-top-0 rounded-top-0\"></div>\n</div>\n\n\n    <div class=\"tmp-px-3 tmp-px-lg-0\">\n  <h2 class=\"h3-mktg tmp-my-4 tmp-my-md-7 col-12 col-md-8\" data-test-selector=\"customer-stories-category-section-heading\">Discover how high-growth companies innovate faster with GitHub Team.</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"d-flex flex-justify-between\">\n    <div  class=\"d-lg-inline-block tmp-pt-3 tmp-pt-lg-0\">\n        <action-menu with_caret=\"true\" data-select-variant=\"none\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"d-inline-block mr-2 tmp-mr-2 my-2 tmp-my-2\">\n  <focus-group direction=\"vertical\" mnemonics retain>\n    <button id=\"action-menu-5a6b35b9-5d8d-49e2-9256-26b00bc2f1db-button\" popovertarget=\"action-menu