7L6.21967 11.7197L7.28033 12.7803L11.5303 8.53033L10.4697 7.46967Z\"></path><path class=\"octicon-chevrow-stem\" stroke=\"currentColor\" d=\"M1.75 8H11\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg>\n    </p>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n    <div  class=\"py-2 tmp-py-sm-4 tmp-mb-4 col-md-4\">\n  <a\n    href=\"/customer-stories/modsy\"\n    class=\"no-underline d-block rounded-1 Link--outlineOffset\"\n  >\n    <span class=\"sr-only\">Read more about Modsy&apos;s customer story</span>\n    <div class=\"tmp-mb-4 position-relative\">\n      <div style=\"height: 268px\">\n        <picture>\n  <source srcset=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=1200&amp;fm=avif 1200w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=960&amp;fm=avif 960w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=720&amp;fm=avif 720w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=600&amp;fm=avif 600w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=480&amp;fm=avif 480w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=240&amp;fm=avif 240w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 755px) 90vw, 40vw\" type=\"image/avif\"></source>\n  <source srcset=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=1200&amp;fm=webp 1200w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=960&amp;fm=webp 960w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=720&amp;fm=webp 720w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=600&amp;fm=webp 600w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=480&amp;fm=webp 480w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=240&amp;fm=webp 240w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 755px) 90vw, 40vw\" type=\"image/webp\"></source>\n  <source srcset=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=1200&amp;fm=jpg 1200w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=960&amp;fm=jpg 960w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=720&amp;fm=jpg 720w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=600&amp;fm=jpg 600w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=480&amp;fm=jpg 480w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=240&amp;fm=jpg 240w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 755px) 90vw, 40vw\" type=\"image/jpeg\"></source>\n  <img class=\"d-block width-full height-full object-fit-cover rounded-2\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1400\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/4kPwr8oVtCnf54HEzxk3Bg/e3b90fc128e617f67a73a1136c5101e7/modsy1.jpg?w=1200&amp;fm=jpg\" />\n</picture>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <h3  class=\"f4-mktg color-fg-muted pb-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> Modsy</h3>\n    <p  class=\"h6-mktg color-fg-default py-1 tmp-pb-sm-4 text-semibold\">Modsy leverages GitHub Team to make interior design easy and accessible for all.</p>\n    <p class=\"f4 d-block d-sm-inline no-underline text-semibold arrow-target-mktg color-fg-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      Read story <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"octicon arrow-symbol-mktg octicon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M7.28033 3.21967C6.98744 2.92678 6.51256 2.92678 6.21967 3.21967C5.92678 3.51256 5.92678 3.98744 6.21967 4.28033L7.28033 3.21967ZM11 8L11.5303 8.53033C11.8232 8.23744 11.8232 7.76256 11.5303 7.46967L11 8ZM6.21967 11.7197C5.92678 12.0126 5.92678 12.4874 6.21967 12.7803C6.51256 13.0732 6.98744 13.0732 7.28033 12.7803L6.21967 11.7197ZM6.21967 4.28033L10.4697 8.53033L11.5303 7.46967L7.28033 3.21967L6.21967 4.28033ZM10.4697 7.46967L6.21967 11.7197L7.28033 12.7803L11.5303 8.53033L10.4697 7.46967Z\"></path><path class=\"octicon-chevrow-stem\" stroke=\"currentColor\" d=\"M1.75 8H11\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg>\n    </p>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n    <section class=\"color-bg-subtle tmp-py-7 tmp-py-lg-10\" aria-labelledby=\"#testimonial-heading\" data-color-mode=light data-light-theme=light data-dark-theme=dark>\n      \n<testimonials-carousel>\n  <div class=\"overflow-hidden tmp-px-3 tmp-pb-8 tmp-pt-5\">\n    <div class=\"container-xl\">\n    <div class=\"col-lg-12 d-lg-flex\">\n      <div class=\"col-lg-4\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">\n        <h3 id=\"testimonial-heading\" class=\"h4-mktg tmp-mb-5\">\n          Here's what software leaders have to say about GitHub\n          <span class=\"sr-only\">Testimonials from our developers.</span>\n        </h3>\n\n        <p class=\"text-bold\">\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-target=\"testimonials-carousel.currentDisplay\">1 / 4</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\" data-target=\"testimonials-carousel.currentAnnounce\">1 of 4</span>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n        <div class=\"width-full position-relative\" data-target=\"testimonials-carousel.container\">\n            <button data-target=\"testimonials-carousel.prevButton\" data-action=\"click:testimonials-carousel#moveToPrev\" aria-label=\"View previous testimonial\" type=\"button\" disabled=\"disabled\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"customer-stories-testimonials__direction circle flex-justify-center flex-items-center customer-stories-testimonials__direction--prev btn d-flex position-absolute border color-bg-default\">    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-arrow-left color-fg-default\">\n    <path d=\"M7.78 12.53a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.47 8.28a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06l4.25-4.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042L4.81 7h7.44a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5H4.81l2.97 2.97a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</button>\n          <div class=\"width-full overflow-hidden\">\n            <ul data-target=\"testimonials-carousel.carousel\" class=\"customer-stories-testimonials\" >\n              <li\n  data-targets=\"testimonials-carousel.carouselItems\"\n  data-action=\"\n    touchstart:testimonials-carousel#onTouchStart\n    touchend:testimonials-carousel#onTouchEnd\n  \"\n  class=\"customer-story-testimonial list-style-none tmp-mx-4\"\n  data-testimonial-active\n  \n>\n  <figure class=\"m-0\">\n    <div class=\"customer-story-testimonial__image overflow-hidden border rounded-2\">\n      <picture>\n  \n  <source srcset=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7qYNHFUpxcV4rGKeGhhi63/29fc5e7ddcba2ebf39862760863754f6/Ali_headshot.png?w=370&amp;fm=webp 370w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7qYNHFUpxcV4rGKeGhhi63/29fc5e7ddcba2ebf39862760863754f6/Ali_headshot.png?w=296&amp;fm=webp 296w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7qYNHFUpxcV4rGKeGhhi63/29fc5e7ddcba2ebf39862760863754f6/Ali_headshot.png?w=222&amp;fm=webp 222w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7qYNHFUpxcV4rGKeGhhi63/29fc5e7ddcba2ebf39862760863754f6/Ali_headshot.png?w=185&amp;fm=webp 185w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7qYNHFUpxcV4rGKeGhhi63/29fc5e7ddcba2ebf39862760863754f6/Ali_headshot.png?w=148&amp;fm=webp 148w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7qYNHFUpxcV4rGKeGhhi63/29fc5e7ddcba2ebf39862760863754f6/Ali_headshot.png?w=74&amp;fm=webp 74w\" type=\"image/webp\"></source>\n  <source srcset=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7qYNHFUpxcV4rGKeGhhi63/29fc5e7ddcba2ebf39862760863754f6/Ali_headshot.png?w=370&amp;fm=png 370w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7qYNHFUpxcV4rGKeGhhi63/29fc5e7ddcba2ebf39862760863754f6/Ali_headshot.png?w=296&amp;fm=png 296w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7qYNHFUpxcV4rGKeGhhi63/29fc5e7ddcba2ebf39862760863754f6/Ali_headshot.png?w=222&amp;fm=png 222w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7qYNHFUpxcV4rGKeGhhi63/29fc5e7ddcba2ebf39862760863754f6/Ali_headshot.png?w=185&amp;fm=png 185w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7qYNHFUpxcV4rGKeGhhi63/29fc5e7ddcba2ebf39862760863754f6/Ali_headshot.png?w=148&amp;fm=png 148w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7qYNHFUpxcV4rGKeGhhi63/29fc5e7ddcba2ebf39862760863754f6/Ali_headshot.png?w=74&amp;fm=png 74w\" type=\"image/png\"></source>\n  <img width=\"370\" height=\"475\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Ali-Reza Adl-Tabatabai&#39;s headshot.\" src=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7qYNHFUpxcV4rGKeGhhi63/29fc5e7ddcba2ebf39862760863754f6/Ali_headshot.png?w=370&amp;fm=png\" />\n</picture>\n    </div>\n\n    <blockquote class=\"customer-story-testimonial__quote f2-mktg tmp-mb-3 clearfix\" >\n      <span class=\"customer-story-testimonial__marker float-left lh-default\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span>\n      <span class=\"clear-left float-left\">\n        At Uber, we continuously strive to improve our developer experience. We migrated code hosting and review to GitHub and are adopting GitHub Copilot to boost overall developer productivity. \n      </span>\n    </blockquote>\n\n    <figcaption>\n      <p class=\"mb-1\">\n        <strong>\n          Ali-Reza Adl-Tabatabai \n        </strong>\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"text-mono\">\n        Senior Director of Engineering\n          @ Uber\n      </p>\n    </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</li>\n\n              <li\n  data-targets=\"testimonials-carousel.carouselItems\"\n  data-action=\"\n    touchstart:testimonials-carousel#onTouchStart\n    touchend:testimonials-carousel#onTouchEnd\n  \"\n  class=\"customer-story-testimonial list-style-none tmp-mx-4\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <figure class=\"m-0\">\n    <div class=\"customer-story-testimonial__image overflow-hidden border rounded-2\">\n      <picture>\n  \n  <source srcset=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/3ulmyRUep8GvUlycjbv62V/b01a3c41fe312cb1b22f4aa28f8f300b/Jen_headshot.png?w=370&amp;fm=webp 370w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/3ulmyRUep8GvUlycjbv62V/b01a3c41fe312cb1b22f4aa28f8f300b/Jen_headshot.png?w=296&amp;fm=webp 296w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/3ulmyRUep8GvUlycjbv62V/b01a3c41fe312cb1b22f4aa28f8f300b/Jen_headshot.png?w=222&amp;fm=webp 222w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/3ulmyRUep8GvUlycjbv62V/b01a3c41fe312cb1b22f4aa28f8f300b/Jen_headshot.png?w=185&amp;fm=webp 185w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/3ulmyRUep8GvUlycjbv62V/b01a3c41fe312cb1b22f4aa28f8f300b/Jen_headshot.png?w=148&amp;fm=webp 148w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/3ulmyRUep8GvUlycjbv62V/b01a3c41fe312cb1b22f4aa28f8f300b/Jen_headshot.png?w=74&amp;fm=webp 74w\" type=\"image/webp\"></source>\n  <source srcset=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/3ulmyRUep8GvUlycjbv62V/b01a3c41fe312cb1b22f4aa28f8f300b/Jen_headshot.png?w=370&amp;fm=png 370w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/3ulmyRUep8GvUlycjbv62V/b01a3c41fe312cb1b22f4aa28f8f300b/Jen_headshot.png?w=296&amp;fm=png 296w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/3ulmyRUep8GvUlycjbv62V/b01a3c41fe312cb1b22f4aa28f8f300b/Jen_headshot.png?w=222&amp;fm=png 222w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/3ulmyRUep8GvUlycjbv62V/b01a3c41fe312cb1b22f4aa28f8f300b/Jen_headshot.png?w=185&amp;fm=png 185w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/3ulmyRUep8GvUlycjbv62V/b01a3c41fe312cb1b22f4aa28f8f300b/Jen_headshot.png?w=148&amp;fm=png 148w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/3ulmyRUep8GvUlycjbv62V/b01a3c41fe312cb1b22f4aa28f8f300b/Jen_headshot.png?w=74&amp;fm=png 74w\" type=\"image/png\"></source>\n  <img width=\"370\" height=\"475\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Jen Peck&#39;s headshot.\" src=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/3ulmyRUep8GvUlycjbv62V/b01a3c41fe312cb1b22f4aa28f8f300b/Jen_headshot.png?w=370&amp;fm=png\" />\n</picture>\n    </div>\n\n    <blockquote class=\"customer-story-testimonial__quote f2-mktg tmp-mb-3 clearfix\" >\n      <span class=\"customer-story-testimonial__marker float-left lh-default\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span>\n      <span class=\"clear-left float-left\">\n        GitHub&#39;s endless plug-ins, beautiful UI, and optimized workflows make devs happy. Happy and empowered engineers write the best code, make better decisions, and have more time to innovate. \n      </span>\n    </blockquote>\n\n    <figcaption>\n      <p class=\"mb-1\">\n        <strong>\n          Jen Peck\n        </strong>\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"text-mono\">\n        Senior Director of Engineering\n          @ Redfin\n      </p>\n    </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</li>\n\n              <li\n  data-targets=\"testimonials-carousel.carouselItems\"\n  data-action=\"\n    touchstart:testimonials-carousel#onTouchStart\n    touchend:testimonials-carousel#onTouchEnd\n  \"\n  class=\"customer-story-testimonial list-style-none tmp-mx-4\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <figure class=\"m-0\">\n    <div class=\"customer-story-testimonial__image overflow-hidden border rounded-2\">\n      <picture>\n  \n  <source srcset=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/1O4CylMFmbyD6V7TrVq3Vu/a653bd5f840f80b3b5ea5e341c1bb65f/Santosh_headshot.png?w=370&amp;fm=webp 370w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/1O4CylMFmbyD6V7TrVq3Vu/a653bd5f840f80b3b5ea5e341c1bb65f/Santosh_headshot.png?w=296&amp;fm=webp 296w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/1O4CylMFmbyD6V7TrVq3Vu/a653bd5f840f80b3b5ea5e341c1bb65f/Santosh_headshot.png?w=222&amp;fm=webp 222w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/1O4CylMFmbyD6V7TrVq3Vu/a653bd5f840f80b3b5ea5e341c1bb65f/Santosh_headshot.png?w=185&amp;fm=webp 185w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/1O4CylMFmbyD6V7TrVq3Vu/a653bd5f840f80b3b5ea5e341c1bb65f/Santosh_headshot.png?w=148&amp;fm=webp 148w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/1O4CylMFmbyD6V7TrVq3Vu/a653bd5f840f80b3b5ea5e341c1bb65f/Santosh_headshot.png?w=74&amp;fm=webp 74w\" type=\"image/webp\"></source>\n  <source srcset=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/1O4CylMFmbyD6V7TrVq3Vu/a653bd5f840f80b3b5ea5e341c1bb65f/Santosh_headshot.png?w=370&amp;fm=png 370w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/1O4CylMFmbyD6V7TrVq3Vu/a653bd5f840f80b3b5ea5e341c1bb65f/Santosh_headshot.png?w=296&amp;fm=png 296w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/1O4CylMFmbyD6V7TrVq3Vu/a653bd5f840f80b3b5ea5e341c1bb65f/Santosh_headshot.png?w=222&amp;fm=png 222w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/1O4CylMFmbyD6V7TrVq3Vu/a653bd5f840f80b3b5ea5e341c1bb65f/Santosh_headshot.png?w=185&amp;fm=png 185w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/1O4CylMFmbyD6V7TrVq3Vu/a653bd5f840f80b3b5ea5e341c1bb65f/Santosh_headshot.png?w=148&amp;fm=png 148w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/1O4CylMFmbyD6V7TrVq3Vu/a653bd5f840f80b3b5ea5e341c1bb65f/Santosh_headshot.png?w=74&amp;fm=png 74w\" type=\"image/png\"></source>\n  <img width=\"370\" height=\"475\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Santosh Lolyekar&#39;s headshot.\" src=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/1O4CylMFmbyD6V7TrVq3Vu/a653bd5f840f80b3b5ea5e341c1bb65f/Santosh_headshot.png?w=370&amp;fm=png\" />\n</picture>\n    </div>\n\n    <blockquote class=\"customer-story-testimonial__quote f2-mktg tmp-mb-3 clearfix\" >\n      <span class=\"customer-story-testimonial__marker float-left lh-default\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span>\n      <span class=\"clear-left float-left\">\n        GitHub Copilot will bring huge benefits to our engineering teams by reducing the amount of time spent on boilerplate code, keeping the teams in their flow state, allowing them to ship high-quality products to market faster.\n      </span>\n    </blockquote>\n\n    <figcaption>\n      <p class=\"mb-1\">\n        <strong>\n          Santosh Lolyeker\n        </strong>\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"text-mono\">\n        VP, Engineering Fellow\n          @ Veritas\n      </p>\n    </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</li>\n\n              <li\n  data-targets=\"testimonials-carousel.carouselItems\"\n  data-action=\"\n    touchstart:testimonials-carousel#onTouchStart\n    touchend:testimonials-carousel#onTouchEnd\n  \"\n  class=\"customer-story-testimonial list-style-none tmp-mx-4\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <figure class=\"m-0\">\n    <div class=\"customer-story-testimonial__image overflow-hidden border rounded-2\">\n      <picture>\n  \n  <source srcset=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7sKronzZMQN0IDEyBqGy7a/569ca365727460b48de4e772833d996c/Avdesh_headshot.png?w=370&amp;fm=webp 370w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7sKronzZMQN0IDEyBqGy7a/569ca365727460b48de4e772833d996c/Avdesh_headshot.png?w=296&amp;fm=webp 296w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7sKronzZMQN0IDEyBqGy7a/569ca365727460b48de4e772833d996c/Avdesh_headshot.png?w=222&amp;fm=webp 222w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7sKronzZMQN0IDEyBqGy7a/569ca365727460b48de4e772833d996c/Avdesh_headshot.png?w=185&amp;fm=webp 185w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7sKronzZMQN0IDEyBqGy7a/569ca365727460b48de4e772833d996c/Avdesh_headshot.png?w=148&amp;fm=webp 148w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7sKronzZMQN0IDEyBqGy7a/569ca365727460b48de4e772833d996c/Avdesh_headshot.png?w=74&amp;fm=webp 74w\" type=\"image/webp\"></source>\n  <source srcset=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7sKronzZMQN0IDEyBqGy7a/569ca365727460b48de4e772833d996c/Avdesh_headshot.png?w=370&amp;fm=png 370w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7sKronzZMQN0IDEyBqGy7a/569ca365727460b48de4e772833d996c/Avdesh_headshot.png?w=296&amp;fm=png 296w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7sKronzZMQN0IDEyBqGy7a/569ca365727460b48de4e772833d996c/Avdesh_headshot.png?w=222&amp;fm=png 222w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7sKronzZMQN0IDEyBqGy7a/569ca365727460b48de4e772833d996c/Avdesh_headshot.png?w=185&amp;fm=png 185w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7sKronzZMQN0IDEyBqGy7a/569ca365727460b48de4e772833d996c/Avdesh_headshot.png?w=148&amp;fm=png 148w,//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7sKronzZMQN0IDEyBqGy7a/569ca365727460b48de4e772833d996c/Avdesh_headshot.png?w=74&amp;fm=png 74w\" type=\"image/png\"></source>\n  <img width=\"370\" height=\"475\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Profile picture of Headshot_Avdesh_Costco\" src=\"//images.ctfassets.net/aukesvz1i7g8/7sKronzZMQN0IDEyBqGy7a/569ca365727460b48de4e772833d996c/Avdesh_headshot.png?w=370&amp;fm=png\" />\n</picture>\n    </div>\n\n    <blockquote class=\"customer-story-testimonial__quote f2-mktg tmp-mb-3 clearfix\" >\n      <span class=\"customer-story-testimonial__marker float-left lh-default\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span>\n      <span class=\"clear-left float-left\">\n        With GitHub Enterprise, we have alleviated engineering overhead at Costco, enabling our engineers to focus on innovating.\n      </span>\n    </blockquote>\n\n    <figcaption>\n      <p class=\"mb-1\">\n        <strong>\n          Avdesh Rai\n        </strong>\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"text-mono\">\n        Enterprise Solutions Engineer\n          @ Costco\n      </p>\n    </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</li>\n\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n            <button data-target=\"testimonials-carousel.nextButton\" data-action=\"click:testimonials-carousel#moveToNext\" aria-label=\"View next testimonial\" type=\"button\" disabled=\"disabled\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"customer-stories-testimonials__direction circle flex-justify-center flex-items-center customer-stories-testimonials__direction--next btn d-flex position-absolute border color-bg-default\">    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-arrow-right\">\n    <path d=\"M8.22 2.97a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.25 4.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042l2.97-2.97H3.75a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h7.44L8.22 4.03a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</button>        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div></testimonials-carousel>\n\n    </section>\n\n  <div class=\"tmp-py-5 tmp-pt-lg-12 tmp-pb-lg-8 position-relative overflow-hidden\" data-color-mode=\"dark\" data-light-theme=\"light\" data-dark-theme=\"dark\">\n    \n<picture>\n  \n  <source srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/assets/footer-background-ce7ac2107b3b.svg 1600w,https://github.githubassets.com/assets/footer-background-ce7ac2107b3b.svg?width=1280 1280w,https://github.githubassets.com/assets/footer-background-ce7ac2107b3b.svg?width=960 960w,https://github.githubassets.com/assets/footer-background-ce7ac2107b3b.svg?width=800 800w,https://github.githubassets.com/assets/footer-background-ce7ac2107b3b.svg?width=640 640w,https://github.githubassets.com/assets/footer-background-ce7ac2107b3b.svg?width=320 320w\" sizes=\"\" type=\"image/svg\"></source>\n  <img class=\"position-absolute top-0 left-0 width-full height-auto d-none d-lg-block\" width=\"1600\" height=\"477\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/assets/footer-background-ce7ac2107b3b.svg\" />\n</picture>\n<div class=\"customer-stories-footer__fade position-absolute top-0 right-0 bottom-0 left-0\"></div>\n<div class=\"container-xl p-responsive position-relative\">\n  <h2 class=\"h1 text-center\">What will your story be?</h2>\n  <p class=\"tmp-mb-7 text-center color-fg-muted f3\">Start collaborating with your team on GitHub</p>\n  <div class=\"d-flex flex-column flex-lg-row\">\n    <div class=\"tmp-mr-lg-3 tmp-mb-3 rounded-2 customer-stories-footer__cta position-relative d-flex flex-1\">\n      <div class=\"rounded-2 tmp-p-4 tmp-p-lg-5 d-flex color-bg-default flex-column flex-justify-between flex-items-start width-full\">\n        <h3 class=\"mb-2 h2\">Free</h3>