aces. Consultez la\",\"for more details.\":\"pour plus de d\\xe9tails.\",\"Participation requires transferring your personal data to other countries in which GitHub operates, including the United States. By submitting this form, you agree to the transfer of your data outside of China.\":\"La participation n\\xe9cessite le transfert de vos donn\\xe9es personnelles vers d\\u2019autres pays dans lesquels GitHub op\\xe8re, y compris les \\xc9tats-Unis. En soumettant ce formulaire, vous acceptez le transfert de vos donn\\xe9es en dehors de la Chine.\",\"I will receive personalized communications and targeted advertising from GitHub and affiliates. See the\":\"Je recevrai des communications personnalis\\xe9es et de la publicit\\xe9 cibl\\xe9e de la part de GitHub et de ses soci\\xe9t\\xe9s affili\\xe9es. Consultez la\",\"Yes, please, I\\u2019d like to hear from GitHub and its family of companies via email for personalized communications, targeted advertising, and campaign effectiveness. To withdraw consent or manage your contact preferences, visit the\":\"Oui, je souhaite recevoir des informations de GitHub et de son groupe d\\u2019entreprises par e-mail pour des communications personnalis\\xe9es, de la publicit\\xe9 cibl\\xe9e et l\\u2019efficacit\\xe9 des campagnes. Pour retirer votre consentement ou g\\xe9rer vos pr\\xe9f\\xe9rences de contact, visitez le\",\"Yes, please, I\\u2019d like to hear from GitHub and its family of companies via email and phone for personalized communications, targeted advertising, and campaign effectiveness. To withdraw consent or manage your contact preferences, visit the\":\"Oui, je souhaite recevoir des informations de GitHub et de son groupe d\\u2019entreprises par e-mail et t\\xe9l\\xe9phone pour des communications personnalis\\xe9es, de la publicit\\xe9 cibl\\xe9e et l\\u2019efficacit\\xe9 des campagnes. Pour retirer votre consentement ou g\\xe9rer vos pr\\xe9f\\xe9rences de contact, visitez le\",\"Promotional Communications Manager\":\